<p class="paper_symposium_authors"><span class='paper_symposium_author'><u>Rosa Duarte</u>; Cristina Sarasa; Sofia Jimenez; Cristina Margalejo; Lucia Bolea; Elena Calvo; Alvaro Garcia; Hans Kremers</span><br /><span class='paper_symposum_organisation'>Universidad de Zaragoza</span></p>

